  message: "Audit-findings 0014 (Edge.evidence_type Cluster C — Framework-Specific Dispatch) filed in PR #3571 (commit 92c4ec781), closing the verdict-table layer of this item. All 65 values FOLD: 56 to canonical inference + meta['framework_dispatch']=<framework_name>; 9 to canonical inference + meta['detection_pattern']=<pattern_name> (abi_name_match, crypto_api_pattern, event_name_match, http_url_match, implicit_convention, jni_naming_convention, phoenix_event_match, subprocess_cli_match, table_name_match). 10 values are dynamic-emit results of two f-strings at linkers/websocket.py:572/613; their producer fold is one PR rewriting the f-strings. ADR-0028 Open Question 1 (apex name for Cluster D ast_call) was already decided in audit-findings 0012; Open Question 2 (framework_dispatch promotion to Edge.framework field) tracks at parent ADR pending Phase 3 emission counts. Item stays todo_hard until producer migration ships across all framework families."  # 877e
